# Tools

Custom tool / command definitions for agents that support them (MCP servers, agent-runner tool specs, etc.).

Suggested layout:

```
tools/
  <tool-name>.ts     # or .js / .mkd manifest, per the target agent's format
```

Prefer thin wrappers over the project's own scripts in [`../../tools/`](../../tools/) and `deno task` entries rather than reimplementing logic. Document each tool's inputs, outputs, and required Deno permissions at the top of its file, and list it in the index below.

_No custom tools defined yet._
